cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and SIMsalabim."
title: "PEROdesign: code and data for cost-aware design of perovskite solar modules"
abstract: >-
  Drift-diffusion simulation (SIMsalabim), a module model and a bottom-up factory-gate cost model, optimised for
  module efficiency and cost per watt with a Bayesian optimiser, NSGA-II and Sobol random search at two
  pre-specified levels of design freedom. Includes all stored runs, result files, the source of every number in
  the paper, and the Source Data workbooks.
